WEBVTT

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:07.382
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：A misty valley… and a strangely good scent.

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:16.233
<v Ieyasu>Ieyasu：I hear water. This must be a land of fine springs.

00:00:16.220 --> 00:00:19.820
<v You>You：Welcome. This is where whisky is born.

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:28.186
<v Ieyasu>Ieyasu：Great tubs, breathing and bubbling.

00:00:29.390 --> 00:00:35.233
<v Ieyasu>Ieyasu：It smells of sweet barley.

00:00:35.870 --> 00:00:38.270
<v You>You：And these are the pot stills.

00:00:36.950 --> 00:00:42.611
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：Look! Giant copper helmets, all in a row!

00:00:43.220 --> 00:00:46.406
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：Hot! Hotter than a smithy!

00:00:46.460 --> 00:00:48.048
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：Ha ha ha!

00:00:49.050 --> 00:00:59.147
<v Ieyasu>Ieyasu：Turning sake into cloud with fire… and back into drops.

00:01:00.280 --> 00:01:02.680
<v You>You：Next, the cask warehouse.

00:01:03.740 --> 00:01:07.475
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：…So quiet. The casks are sleeping.

00:01:07.840 --> 00:01:10.840
<v You>You：They sleep in the casks for years.

00:01:12.160 --> 00:01:18.052
<v Ieyasu>Ieyasu：They call it the angels' share.

00:01:19.070 --> 00:01:23.738
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：Those angels drink before me?

00:01:24.260 --> 00:01:26.860
<v You>You：Come and see the spring water, too.

00:01:27.930 --> 00:01:36.103
<v Ieyasu>Ieyasu：Cold… such clear water. This water is the soul of the sake.

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:40.400
<v You>You：Finally, a tasting. First, just smell it, neat.

00:01:41.320 --> 00:01:45.787
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：…Wait. I know this scent.

00:01:46.290 --> 00:01:54.425
<v Ieyasu>Ieyasu：My lord — that night at Azuchi… the sake this one brought us!

00:01:55.140 --> 00:01:58.359
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：So this is where it was born!

00:01:58.600 --> 00:02:00.188
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：Ha ha ha!

00:02:00.330 --> 00:02:02.130
<v You>You：Let's have a toast!

00:02:02.270 --> 00:02:03.620
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：Cheers!

00:02:02.490 --> 00:02:03.840
<v Ieyasu>Ieyasu：Cheers!

00:02:04.650 --> 00:02:06.000
<v Ieyasu>Ieyasu：Ho ho ho.

00:02:08.970 --> 00:02:15.337
<v Ieyasu>Ieyasu：I would like to take a cask home to Azuchi.

00:02:16.100 --> 00:02:19.700
<v You>You：Next time, I'll bring this cask to Azuchi.
